{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42181","headline":"陪王庶子游後湖涵虚阁 · 徐铉","name":"陪王庶子游後湖涵虚阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悬圃清虚乍过秋，看山寻水上兹楼。\n轻鸥的的飞难没，红叶纷纷晚更稠。\n风卷微云分远岫，浪摇晴日照中洲。\n跻攀况有承华客，如在南皮奉胜游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}